🏠 Hostel System

🎯 Hostel Availability

DreamVerse me Hostel System real college ke hisaab se hoga.

- Jis college me real life me hostel hota hai, wahan DreamVerse me bhi hoga.

- Jis college ko hostel ki zarurat nahi hogi, wahan hostel nahi banega.

---

🏢 Hostel Types

Har college ke hisaab se:

- 👦 Boys Hostel
- 👧 Girls Hostel

Alag-alag honge.

---

🚪 Room Types

Har hostel me alag room options honge.

Example (40 Rooms):

- 👤 10 Single Rooms
- 👥 10 Double Rooms
- 👥👥 10 Four Student Rooms
- 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 10 Group Rooms

Room distribution har college ke hisaab se badal sakti hai.

---

🏠 Room Selection

Situation 1

Bahut saare rooms khaali hain.

➡️ Player apni pasand ka room choose kar sakta hai.

---

Situation 2

Kam rooms available hain.

➡️ Sirf available rooms me se choose kar sakta hai.

---

Situation 3

Sirf ek room bacha hai.

➡️ Wahi automatically allot ho jayega.

---

🔄 Room Change

Player agar room change karna chahta hai to:

- 📝 Warden ko Application deni hogi.
- Reason batana hoga.

Warden:

- Reason genuine hua.
- Room available hua.

To room change approve karega.

Otherwise request reject ho jayegi.

