🆕 Custom Club System

Player khud bhi Club bana sakta hai.

Process:

1. 📝 Principal ko Application.
2. Club ka Name.
3. Club ka Purpose.
4. Activities ka Description.

Principal approve karega.

Approve hone ke baad:

- 👑 Player Founder / Club Leader ban jayega.
- 👥 Dusre Players join kar sakenge.
- 📢 Members recruit kar sakta hai.
- 🎉 Club apne Events organize kar sakta hai.
- 📜 Club ka Banner aur Identity bana sakta hai.

Ye feature poori tarah optional hoga.

